      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRASS BAND (2) capped off some strong form with an overdue maiden win at Grafton, and the manner in which he won that race suggests that it won't be his last. Stick with him. TRUSTY BANDIT (3) finished ahead of the top pick in the same race at Gatton 5-days ago, and he is reunited with winning hoop Brandon Lerena. His record around this course is very strong, and with that being a big advantage, he can win this. LORD DANILO (5) has raced his way into some good form, and all of his best performances, including his only win, has come around this circuit. Each way. SEERESS (7) has a good record on this track, winning 3-times, and her win at Lismore 11 days ago was by nearly 3 lengths. She carries the same weight, and can repeat the dose.",
